WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.960
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:36.590 --> 01:38.890
<b>-Is this the way?
-Yes.</b>

01:38.970 --> 01:41.850
<b>If we cross the ridge, we'll come across
the road the enemies withdrew from.</b>

01:41.930 --> 01:44.390
<b>Oh, my gosh! I just ate a spider's web.</b>

01:44.470 --> 01:45.980
<b>-Don't be so loud.
-Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

01:46.060 --> 01:47.560
<b>Gross.</b>

01:48.060 --> 01:50.940
<b>How do you feel now that you've had
your first victorious battle?</b>

01:51.610 --> 01:53.270
<b>I guess it was my first battle.</b>

01:53.860 --> 01:56.110
<b>I was just focused on running,</b>

01:56.190 --> 01:59.070
<b>and before I knew it,
the enemy's head was right in front of me.</b>

02:03.450 --> 02:04.290
<b>I…</b>

02:07.460 --> 02:09.710
<b>I want to say thank you.</b>

02:10.750 --> 02:12.090
<b>Don't mention it!</b>

02:13.170 --> 02:17.760
<b>There are conditions to winning a war
by way of the game of tag.</b>

02:18.970 --> 02:22.010
<b><i>First, you must be</i>
<i>a valuable leader in battle,</i></b>

02:22.100 --> 02:24.140
<b><i>which means you will become</i>
<i>the top target.</i></b>

02:24.720 --> 02:28.100
<b><i>Second, you must have trustworthy</i>
<i>retainers who'll act as your weapons.</i></b>

02:28.730 --> 02:30.770
<b><i>In order to fulfill these two conditions,</i></b>

02:31.480 --> 02:35.480
<b>you must not forget your pride
as a Hojo orphan.</b>

02:35.980 --> 02:39.780
<b>And you must be a boy of character
who people will be drawn to.</b>

02:40.860 --> 02:42.530
<b><i>If you do those two things,</i></b>

02:43.240 --> 02:47.290
<b>one day, you can defeat any demon
in the game of tag.</b>

02:52.750 --> 02:53.790
<b>I understand.</b>

02:59.840 --> 03:03.300
<b>I swear to return here.</b>

03:04.390 --> 03:08.680
<b>And defeat Ashikaga,
who caused all the turmoil!</b>

03:12.020 --> 03:13.020
<b>You are heroic.</b>

03:14.520 --> 03:18.110
<b>And also, I saw another vision
a moment ago.</b>

03:19.320 --> 03:23.490
<b>I saw that something terrible would happen
if you throw that sword from there.</b>

03:24.030 --> 03:25.450
<b>-Uh-oh.
-My lord!</b>

03:25.530 --> 03:26.580
<b>Be careful! Get back!</b>

03:32.290 --> 03:36.420
<b><i>Tokiyuki narrowly escaped</i>
<i>a ruined Kamakura.</i></b>

03:37.000 --> 03:40.670
<b><i>For someone of such small stature,</i>
<i>he has such a grand fate awaiting him.</i></b>

03:41.340 --> 03:45.140
<b><i>The boy who will later shake the country</i></b>

03:45.220 --> 03:49.390
<b><i>begins his growth in his new world.</i></b>

03:50.270 --> 03:51.390
<b><i>However…</i></b>

03:53.600 --> 03:56.770
<b>Good morning, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

03:56.860 --> 04:00.280
<b>You're looking quite good for someone
who was running around all day yesterday.</b>

04:00.360 --> 04:03.530
<b>Mr. Yorishige! What is this inappropriate
atmosphere with the shrine maidens?</b>

04:03.610 --> 04:05.160
<b>Lord Tokiyuki, try a locust!</b>

04:05.240 --> 04:08.790
<b>I appointed them to bring you breakfast
and physical contact</b>

04:08.870 --> 04:11.290
<b>to warm your grieving heart!</b>

04:12.500 --> 04:14.000
<b>And what do you make of this?</b>

04:14.080 --> 04:16.500
<b>As you can see,
I've dug a hole to trap you.</b>

04:16.580 --> 04:20.380
<b>I saw a future where you were
running down this road to get away!</b>

04:21.010 --> 04:22.670
<b>Since this place is filled
with divine energy,</b>

04:22.760 --> 04:25.180
<b>-it gives me a boost of holy power…
-<i>He said he saw a vision.</i></b>

04:25.260 --> 04:27.010
<b><i>He's still speaking like a sham.</i></b>

04:27.760 --> 04:28.890
<b>Which means--</b>

04:28.970 --> 04:33.270
<b>No matter where you run off to,
I'll know right away.</b>

04:33.850 --> 04:37.730
<b>You see, this is my backyard. My domain!</b>

04:40.480 --> 04:42.900
<b>Behold, this is the Suwa Grand Shrine!</b>

04:54.000 --> 04:55.080
<b>Now.</b>

04:55.170 --> 04:59.040
<b>Come now, let's start your martial
and academic arts training.</b>

04:59.130 --> 05:00.750
<b>ANCIENT COURT
AND MILITARY PRACTICES</b>

05:00.840 --> 05:02.840
<b>But I'm still acclimating.</b>

05:02.920 --> 05:05.510
<b>The boy who symbolizes
Kamakura shogunate's restoration</b>

05:05.590 --> 05:07.760
<b>has no time to waste!</b>

05:16.310 --> 05:19.730
<b>All right, take two! A "running gag" is
a word I learned from the future.</b>

05:19.810 --> 05:23.150
<b>But repeating the same joke
a third time won't work.</b>

05:23.230 --> 05:24.780
<b>I don't care. Let me out!</b>

05:24.860 --> 05:26.860
<b>I'm sorry, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

05:27.360 --> 05:29.700
<b>Father is always like this,</b>

05:29.780 --> 05:32.790
<b>-forcing things along on his own terms.
-What's this?</b>

05:33.450 --> 05:35.330
<b>He often behaves in eccentric ways,</b>

05:35.410 --> 05:38.040
<b>-and he goes on about nonsense.
-Roast deer over rice?</b>

05:38.120 --> 05:40.790
<b>Shizuku, I think I found something tasty.</b>

05:40.880 --> 05:43.800
<b>But he means well, so don't worry.</b>

05:43.880 --> 05:46.220
<b>How can I not worry hearing that?</b>

05:46.880 --> 05:51.140
<b>Father, why would you dig a hole
in the road leading to the shrine?</b>

05:51.220 --> 05:53.560
<b>-I'm sorry.
-<i>I'm grateful to this man</i></b>

05:53.640 --> 05:54.850
<b><i>for saving my life,</i></b>

05:55.600 --> 05:59.810
<b><i>but does he have</i>
<i>any realistic plans for what's to come?</i></b>

06:00.810 --> 06:04.900
<b><i>Suwa Shrine is so much smaller</i>
<i>than Tsurugaoka Hachimangu Shrine,</i></b>

06:05.610 --> 06:08.490
<b><i>so it's hard to believe</i>
<i>that the priest of this shrine</i></b>

06:08.570 --> 06:13.240
<b><i>can help me take back Kamakura</i>
<i>and defeat Takauji Ashikaga.</i></b>

06:15.700 --> 06:17.870
<b>SEVERAL DAYS LATER</b>

06:18.960 --> 06:21.750
<b>I can't believe he doesn't get tired
of running away so much day after day.</b>

06:21.840 --> 06:24.800
<b>Ugh, I'm tired of digging holes.</b>

06:24.880 --> 06:28.340
<b>That Young Lord… Isn't he spoiled,
being the heir to the shogunate?</b>

06:28.430 --> 06:30.970
<b>Maybe he learned to run away
from everything.</b>

06:32.050 --> 06:33.100
<b>You're wrong.</b>

06:34.010 --> 06:36.220
<b>At his core, he's honest and earnest.</b>

06:37.310 --> 06:40.100
<b><i>But he has never understood</i>
<i>the reason to study diligently</i></b>

06:40.600 --> 06:44.610
<b><i>because he was raised</i>
<i>to be a puppet ruler.</i></b>

06:45.440 --> 06:49.110
<b><i>He's never had any</i>
<i>meaningful goals in his life.</i></b>

06:53.950 --> 06:55.740
<b>If anything, I'm the one who's lacking.</b>

06:56.240 --> 07:00.790
<b>I haven't proven to him yet</b>

07:01.540 --> 07:05.920
<b>whether I have the power
to help him reach his goals!</b>

07:12.340 --> 07:14.680
<b>No one will think I'll run away
on a day like this.</b>

07:16.140 --> 07:22.350
<b>Learning the art of war today? It seems
most useless for someone like me.</b>

07:29.280 --> 07:30.450
<b>Oh, come on.</b>

07:31.150 --> 07:32.660
<b>I don't need to study.</b>

07:32.740 --> 07:34.870
<b>I'll do what you want.</b>

07:37.290 --> 07:40.580
<b>All I need to do is run around
the battlefield, right?</b>

07:42.370 --> 07:46.380
<b>Even while your army is losing!</b>

07:51.170 --> 07:56.470
<b>Lord Tokiyuki,
I promise to God, I cannot lose.</b>

07:57.010 --> 07:58.640
<b>You know why?</b>

07:58.720 --> 08:00.890
<b>Because I am a true god.</b>

08:02.810 --> 08:05.900
<b>This rain is in the way.
I need to show you something.</b>

08:09.400 --> 08:10.740
<b>Now…</b>

08:12.280 --> 08:13.490
<b>I'll clear the clouds.</b>

09:01.410 --> 09:03.370
<b>Hip, hip…</b>

09:04.250 --> 09:06.920
<b>Hooray!</b>

09:07.000 --> 09:09.340
<b>Hip, hip…</b>

09:10.000 --> 09:12.590
<b>Hooray!</b>

09:13.260 --> 09:15.260
<b>Hip, hip…</b>

09:15.880 --> 09:19.300
<b>Hooray!</b>

09:19.390 --> 09:21.060
<b>Amazing!</b>

09:21.810 --> 09:25.640
<b>The Suwa Sect is composed of warriors
who believe in Suwa Myojin,</b>

09:25.730 --> 09:31.520
<b>and they are proud of their strength
and iron unity under their faith in me.</b>

09:33.570 --> 09:35.610
<b>Was I able to convince you?</b>

09:36.740 --> 09:39.950
<b>There is a god looking after you.</b>

09:41.030 --> 09:44.450
<b>10,000 men on horseback
at one call from god.</b>

09:44.540 --> 09:47.210
<b><i>If you acquire the qualities of a hero,</i></b>

09:47.710 --> 09:49.960
<b><i>it would mean an alliance</i>
<i>between a hero and a god.</i></b>

09:50.040 --> 09:52.630
<b><i>And even more soldiers will</i>
<i>join us tenfold!</i></b>

09:54.210 --> 09:57.340
<b>So what shall we do today?</b>

10:00.890 --> 10:05.850
<b>I'll go to my desk and study.</b>

10:08.690 --> 10:10.440
<b>That's what I wanted to hear!</b>

10:10.520 --> 10:13.190
<b>-Your aged cheek is surprisingly…
-You adorable thing.</b>

10:13.270 --> 10:16.740
<b>-…like a nail file!
-Rub, rub, rub, rub, rub, rub!</b>

10:18.200 --> 10:19.740
<b><i>I think I'll trust him.</i></b>

10:20.620 --> 10:25.080
<b><i>I think he'll make me a hero</i>
<i>like he predicted.</i></b>

10:30.290 --> 10:32.630
<b>I've got those words out of him.</b>

10:33.210 --> 10:36.460
<b>Everyone, you're welcome to go home!</b>

10:39.010 --> 10:39.840
<b>* TOKIYUKI
</b>

10:39.930 --> 10:42.100
<b>That was rough in the rain.</b>

10:45.100 --> 10:49.440
<b>Hey, where'd the enthusiasm go? Come on!</b>

10:49.520 --> 10:53.150
<b>Well, they're not
always that energetic, you see.</b>

10:53.230 --> 10:56.070
<b>Come on, let's knock out the studying.</b>

10:57.360 --> 11:01.490
<b>-You know a warrior can't lie! Come on.
-You tricked me!</b>

11:01.570 --> 11:05.410
<b>-<i>Yorishige Suwa understood Tokiyuki best…</i>
-Let's get started.</b>

11:05.490 --> 11:08.330
<b><i>…and managed to enlighten him</i>
<i>on his future.</i></b>

11:08.410 --> 11:11.920
<b><i>In just a short while,</i>
<i>he had an immeasurable impact.</i></b>

11:15.090 --> 11:16.380
<b><i>And now,</i></b>

11:17.800 --> 11:21.470
<b><i>the hero hatchling begins to quietly</i>
<i>sharpen his fang in the arms of a god.</i></b>

11:22.550 --> 11:23.970
<b>What a clean fall!</b>

11:24.050 --> 11:25.060
<b>Shut up!</b>

11:32.020 --> 11:34.520
<b>It looks like you're getting used to
life in Suwa.</b>

11:35.860 --> 11:39.490
<b>Now, it's time to gain some allies.</b>

11:39.990 --> 11:42.740
<b>Let's gather retainers just for you.</b>

11:42.820 --> 11:44.120
<b>-Yes.
-Yes.</b>

11:44.700 --> 11:45.870
<b>Retainers.</b>

11:45.950 --> 11:46.950
<b>WHAT ARE "RETAINERS"?</b>

11:47.040 --> 11:50.330
<b><i>Yes. Retainers are vassals that form</i>
<i>a master-and-servant relationship</i></b>

11:50.410 --> 11:52.250
<b><i>with their potent military commander.</i></b>

11:52.330 --> 11:54.500
<b><i>And they risk their lives</i>
<i>fighting for him.</i></b>

11:54.580 --> 11:56.960
<b><i>It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say that</i></b>

11:57.050 --> 11:59.840
<b><i>the strength of the retainers</i>
<i>is the strength of the lord.</i></b>

12:00.510 --> 12:05.680
<b><i>Because you've tragically lost</i>
<i>your close family and retainers,</i></b>

12:05.760 --> 12:08.600
<b><i>you must rebuild from nothing.</i></b>

12:10.850 --> 12:13.100
<b>Allow me to introduce them again!</b>

12:15.610 --> 12:19.570
<b><i>Kojiro is the greatest swordsman</i>
<i>of your generation.</i></b>

12:19.650 --> 12:21.990
<b><i>And one day he will lead</i>
<i>as your military commander.</i></b>

12:22.610 --> 12:23.610
<b>Sup, Young Lord.</b>

12:24.700 --> 12:28.830
<b><i>Ayako has unrivaled physical strength</i>
<i>and is brimming with artistic talent.</i></b>

12:28.910 --> 12:30.750
<b><i>She remains a lady even in battle.</i></b>

12:30.830 --> 12:32.580
<b>Young Lord!</b>

12:34.000 --> 12:38.290
<b><i>Shizuku is attentive</i>
<i>and versed in several secret arts.</i></b>

12:38.800 --> 12:41.670
<b><i>As a servant, she takes care of</i>
<i>the general affairs at home.</i></b>

12:43.760 --> 12:49.060
<b>These three are your age,
but I know you can count on them.</b>

12:49.600 --> 12:51.890
<b>First, get to know them well,</b>

12:51.980 --> 12:54.190
<b>and show that you know
how to utilize their skills.</b>

12:56.150 --> 12:59.520
<b>If you all grow up together, like family,</b>

13:00.030 --> 13:04.280
<b><i>then eventually you will have</i>
<i>tight-knit, reliable retainers.</i></b>

13:05.410 --> 13:09.910
<b><i>And in the future, we'll recruit</i>
<i>more talent as we come across them.</i></b>

13:09.990 --> 13:12.410
<b>The number of your retainers
is sure to grow!</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:15.620
<b>In the future, this is what they call</b>

13:15.710 --> 13:20.380
<b>a hero's journey.</b>

13:20.460 --> 13:21.550
<b>Who cares?</b>

13:22.510 --> 13:25.680
<b>Right, then, what shall I do, my lord?</b>

13:26.380 --> 13:28.890
<b>I'll do anything you ask.</b>

13:29.760 --> 13:30.760
<b>Anything?</b>

13:30.850 --> 13:33.480
<b>Of course. We're retainers!</b>

13:40.900 --> 13:43.110
<b>Then let's play tag!</b>

13:43.190 --> 13:44.190
<b>Oh, not that.</b>

13:44.280 --> 13:45.650
<b>Instant rejection!</b>

13:46.150 --> 13:48.620
<b>My lord, once you start running,
you go far into the horizon.</b>

13:48.700 --> 13:49.910
<b>YAY
</b>

13:49.990 --> 13:53.540
<b>Right? In a way, it's amazing
how much energy you have to run.</b>

13:54.160 --> 13:56.870
<b>If we're gonna do something fun,
let's sneak into the samurai's houses,</b>

13:56.960 --> 13:58.750
<b>the ones that betrayed you for Ashikaga.</b>

13:58.830 --> 14:01.000
<b>Then we'll all take a dump
and rub it in everywhere.</b>

14:01.090 --> 14:02.000
<b>How crass!</b>

14:02.090 --> 14:05.630
<b>-Let's do push-ups till someone gives up!
-That sounds like hell!</b>

14:05.720 --> 14:09.640
<b>I want to see how many marbles will fit
in an ants' nest.</b>

14:09.720 --> 14:10.890
<b>What's wrong with you?</b>

14:10.970 --> 14:14.060
<b>-<i>What is wrong with…</i>
-One, two…</b>

14:14.140 --> 14:15.390
<b>…my retainers?</b>

14:17.640 --> 14:20.770
<b>Young Lord, how about we go hunting?</b>

14:20.860 --> 14:23.150
<b>It's fun and it'll be good training.</b>

14:24.980 --> 14:27.240
<b>Are those of the shrine allowed
to kill animals?</b>

14:27.320 --> 14:28.610
<b>It's okay.</b>

14:29.200 --> 14:32.240
<b>Suwa Myojin is also a God of Hunting.</b>

14:32.910 --> 14:36.500
<b>Unlike other Shinto sects,
we hunt and eat like crazy.</b>

14:40.170 --> 14:41.460
<b><i>What a strange god.</i></b>

14:44.090 --> 14:45.090
<b>Lord Yorishige.</b>

14:46.420 --> 14:49.220
<b>It seems Lord Tokiyuki's group
has gone hunting.</b>

14:51.850 --> 14:53.220
<b>I saw that.</b>

14:53.850 --> 14:57.350
<b>I saw the tribulations they'll face too.</b>

15:02.480 --> 15:03.480
<b>Surprise!</b>

15:10.660 --> 15:13.580
<b>-Wow. Close one. By your standards.
-What do you mean "by your standards"?</b>

15:13.660 --> 15:15.870
<b>It's hard to see through the foliage here.</b>

15:22.460 --> 15:23.460
<b>Wow!</b>

15:23.960 --> 15:25.550
<b>Here, my lord! One more time.</b>

15:25.630 --> 15:27.670
<b>Found you!</b>

15:32.090 --> 15:34.760
<b>Dang, Mr. Rabbit is fast.</b>

15:36.260 --> 15:37.600
<b>She's a monster.</b>

15:37.680 --> 15:42.400
<b>Right? I've seen her turn rabbits
into red mist plenty of times.</b>

15:42.480 --> 15:44.940
<b>Wait!</b>

15:50.360 --> 15:51.360
<b>What is that beast?</b>

15:54.410 --> 15:56.490
<b>It was rumored in the neighboring province</b>

15:58.120 --> 16:01.750
<b>that there's a huge
flesh-eating Ox Demon in these hills.</b>

16:04.830 --> 16:05.880
<b><i>Lord Tokiyuki,</i></b>

16:06.460 --> 16:12.680
<b><i>your adversary is a man</i>
<i>who subjugates far more ferocious beasts.</i></b>

16:13.890 --> 16:16.430
<b><i>Show me how you can combine</i>
<i>strength with your allies</i></b>

16:18.010 --> 16:19.680
<b><i>to splendidly take down this beast.</i></b>

16:19.770 --> 16:22.440
<b>NANBOKUCHO GAME OF TAG
OX DEMON BOTAN</b>

16:31.110 --> 16:32.650
<b>It won't even pierce its skin.</b>

16:35.200 --> 16:36.910
<b>Retreat! Retreat to higher ground!</b>

16:44.670 --> 16:46.960
<b>We can't defeat it
with just the two of us.</b>

16:47.040 --> 16:49.250
<b>We will guide the Young Lord while we run.</b>

16:49.340 --> 16:50.340
<b>Okay!</b>

16:51.880 --> 16:53.930
<b>No, we can defeat it.</b>

16:54.590 --> 16:56.970
<b>-Shizuku!
-Since when did you get to safety?</b>

16:57.050 --> 16:59.760
<b>Kojiro, Aya,
it's not just you two anymore.</b>

16:59.850 --> 17:02.390
<b>We have Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

17:02.480 --> 17:03.480
<b>Me?</b>

17:03.560 --> 17:05.440
<b>CURRENT LOCATION</b>

17:05.520 --> 17:10.280
<b>Lord Tokiyuki, you evade the beast
while leading it to the larch.</b>

17:10.780 --> 17:11.610
<b>DESTINATION</b>

17:11.690 --> 17:14.900
<b>While you do that,
Kojiro and Aya will wait for it there.</b>

17:15.860 --> 17:17.370
<b>You two already know, right?</b>

17:17.870 --> 17:20.540
<b>What's under the tree.</b>

17:20.620 --> 17:21.620
<b>-Yes.
-Yes.</b>

17:22.450 --> 17:25.500
<b>All right, my lord.
Till then, it's all yours!</b>

17:25.580 --> 17:28.960
<b>Hey, wait! What do you mean it's all mine?</b>

17:33.300 --> 17:36.050
<b><i>And you want me to lead it</i>
<i>while dodging it?</i></b>

17:36.630 --> 17:38.470
<b><i>That's insane!</i></b>

17:40.100 --> 17:43.100
<b>What kind of retainer makes their lord be</b>

17:43.180 --> 17:48.100
<b>a part of this sort of plan!</b>

17:49.150 --> 17:51.730
<b>He says that, but he's evading
in ungodly rapid succession!</b>

17:51.820 --> 17:52.820
<b>Looking good!</b>

17:52.900 --> 17:56.150
<b>Our lord has an astounding talent
in dodging.</b>

17:58.240 --> 18:01.700
<b>Let's fine-tune it!</b>

18:04.120 --> 18:05.500
<b>It's ready!</b>

18:05.580 --> 18:07.830
<b>-Straight under the tree!
-All right!</b>

18:13.710 --> 18:17.050
<b>Hey! What am I supposed to do with it now?</b>

18:22.310 --> 18:23.930
<b>Come on, you swine,</b>

18:24.720 --> 18:27.600
<b>for baring your fangs
at Tokiyuki Hojo's party,</b>

18:29.100 --> 18:30.560
<b>I'll make sure you regret it.</b>

18:33.820 --> 18:35.690
<b>Neither arrow nor sword could hurt you.</b>

18:37.030 --> 18:39.490
<b>You wouldn't die
even if you fell off a cliff.</b>

18:40.660 --> 18:42.030
<b>I'm sorry,</b>

18:42.830 --> 18:46.450
<b>but what awaits you there
is the blade of god.</b>

18:53.590 --> 18:55.130
<b>The water feels just right.</b>

18:55.210 --> 18:58.220
<b>Hot springs are a Suwa specialty!</b>

19:01.140 --> 19:02.220
<b><i>Good heavens.</i></b>

19:02.890 --> 19:04.310
<b>-Yay!
-Yay!</b>

19:04.810 --> 19:06.850
<b>-<i>We killed the beast in no time.</i>
-That was hard.</b>

19:06.930 --> 19:08.270
<b>I want to butcher and eat it…</b>

19:08.350 --> 19:10.480
<b><i>Once we saw the bow wasn't effective,</i>
<i>we figured out how</i></b>

19:10.560 --> 19:12.400
<b><i>to work with each other's</i>
<i>individual strengths.</i></b>

19:12.480 --> 19:14.650
<b><i>We used our resourcefulness</i>
<i>to our advantage,</i></b>

19:14.730 --> 19:17.320
<b><i>and didn't hesitate</i>
<i>to deal with this unknown monster.</i></b>

19:17.400 --> 19:20.240
<b>Young Lord! Let's go to the spring!</b>

19:20.320 --> 19:22.740
<b>But what was this beast?</b>

19:23.830 --> 19:26.910
<b>It was probably a beast
remaining from ancient times.</b>

19:29.750 --> 19:32.500
<b>It didn't even have family
to bear offspring.</b>

19:34.710 --> 19:36.840
<b>If there were others of its kind,</b>

19:37.460 --> 19:40.430
<b>it probably wouldn't have fallen
under the influence of evil.</b>

19:43.930 --> 19:44.930
<b>From now on,</b>

19:45.010 --> 19:48.140
<b>let's conduct Tokiyuki party's
strategic meetings in the hot springs!</b>

19:48.850 --> 19:49.930
<b>I like that!</b>

19:50.520 --> 19:52.480
<b>I'm going to bring ice
from the ice chamber</b>

19:52.560 --> 19:53.810
<b>and some mandarin juice.</b>

19:57.900 --> 20:01.990
<b>You know, "Tokiyuki Party"
is too obvious to enemies.</b>

20:02.490 --> 20:04.450
<b>Let's think of something more vague!</b>

20:05.370 --> 20:06.830
<b>Let's see…</b>

20:07.410 --> 20:10.540
<b>Since we're a party that uses
our lord's "running" as its main tactic,</b>

20:11.120 --> 20:12.710
<b>"Wrap Up Your Tail and Flee Party"!</b>

20:12.790 --> 20:13.920
<b>Lame!</b>

20:14.000 --> 20:15.750
<b>-Sweet-tooth Party!
-Definitely not!</b>

20:15.840 --> 20:17.170
<b>Born to Runner Up Party.</b>

20:17.250 --> 20:19.300
<b>I don't think that's good?</b>

20:19.380 --> 20:21.220
<b>-Loser's Pick Party!
-That hurts!</b>

20:21.300 --> 20:23.340
<b>Flighting Escaping Just Run Party!</b>

20:23.430 --> 20:24.430
<b>That's so long!</b>

20:24.510 --> 20:27.560
<b>-<i>Although I've lost everything…</i>
-Hi-yah!</b>

20:27.640 --> 20:30.640
<b><i>…they cheer me up</i>
<i>by treating me like a friend.</i></b>

20:31.270 --> 20:35.150
<b><i>And still, they don't forget</i>
<i>that I'm their lord.</i></b>

20:40.440 --> 20:41.610
<b>I know!</b>

20:41.700 --> 20:43.700
<b>What about "the Elusive Warriors"?</b>

20:44.360 --> 20:45.530
<b>How'd you come up with that?</b>

20:46.120 --> 20:49.740
<b>Because we are warriors
for an elusive lord!</b>

20:54.210 --> 20:57.960
<b>Yes. The Elusive Warriors. That's good.</b>

20:59.300 --> 21:02.090
<b><i>These retainers are too good for me.</i></b>

21:04.050 --> 21:07.680
<b><i>Let's all grow strong together</i>
<i>in this land!</i></b>

21:11.140 --> 21:16.310
<b>Now, let's eat
the good parts of that beast first.</b>

21:16.400 --> 21:19.110
<b>We'll tell Lord Yorishige about it after.</b>

21:19.190 --> 21:20.030
<b>What?</b>

21:21.440 --> 21:22.900
<b>What the…</b>

21:22.990 --> 21:25.780
<b>Why did you eat our whole catch,
you dumb god!</b>

21:26.990 --> 21:29.450
<b>It was a pitiful beast
that fell to the influence of evil!</b>

21:30.330 --> 21:32.330
<b>I'm purifying its soul
in my sacred stomach.</b>

21:32.410 --> 21:34.500
<b>BEAST THAT'S STRANGE TO ME
WILL WANDER IN GLOOMY DARKNESS</b>

21:34.580 --> 21:37.170
<b>-Shut up! Give me back my meat!
-You're a gluttonous god!</b>

21:38.130 --> 21:39.130
<b>REJECTED</b>

21:39.210 --> 21:40.800
<b>What is going on in this god's stomach?</b>

21:49.760 --> 21:50.850
<b>I see.</b>

21:51.390 --> 21:52.770
<b>I can see it.</b>

21:53.310 --> 21:57.900
<b>Yorishige of Suwa is plotting
something wicked.</b>

22:00.110 --> 22:02.280
<b>I'll never let him get away with it.</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.910
<b>EPISODE 4 (YEAR OF 1333):
SADAMUNE APPEARS!</b>

